  output: crop = bbox of the largest component (= board bbox), with each color layer rotated 90*rot_k CW; colors without a cue are unchanged
generation_strategy:
  approach: output-first then invert rotation
  steps:
    - Pick N in 10-13 and choose 3 distinct non-bg colors (c_frame, c_mid, c_inner); mark c_frame as outermost
